                <head>No. 242<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>On July 27, the Senate Committee on Foreign Relations met with Secretary of State
                    Dulles in executive session; the two plane incidents were discussed briefly. For
                    a record of the discussion, see <hi rendition="#italic">Executive Sessions of
                        the Senate Foreign Relations Committee (Historical Series)</hi>, volume VI,
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Eighty-third Congress, Second Session, 1954</hi>
                    (Washington, Government Printing Office, 1977), pages 690–692 and 697–702.</p>
            </div>
